        <https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#rule/MANIFEST_DECISION_RIGHT_RESPECTED>,
        <https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#rule/MIFID2_ART24_RATIONALE> .

